0..76 Comment "//! An extension type stated by its `ext` member: `ext Cell = Val on left is"
77..150 Comment "//! zero` declares the sort of cells of `Val` fixed to `zero` on the face"
151..233 Comment "//! `left`, and the face theory generates its signature — `inCell` introducing a"
234..311 Comment "//! cell by its values off the face, `outCellp` reading it at each point `p`,"
312..372 Comment "//! and the boundary, β and η laws among the block\'s rules"
373..451 Comment "//! [Zhang-2024-three_noncubical_applications_extension_types]. Each generated"
452..532 Comment "//! member is named for its point by the point\'s name. Over two points it is the"
533..581 Comment "//! signature `zero-fiber.gandr` writes by hand."
582..585 Comment "//!"
586..601 Comment "//! - see: #641"
602..673 Comment "//! - cites: [Zhang-2024-three_noncubical_applications_extension_types]"
674..677 Comment "//!"
678..833 Comment "//! [Zhang-2024-three_noncubical_applications_extension_types]: https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.05658 \"Zhang, Three non-cubical applications of extension types\""
835..911 Comment "/// The cells of `Val` over `Two` fixed to `zero` on `left`, with `c` a cell"
912..990 Comment "/// nothing introduces. The boundary reads `zero` at `left` of every cell, `c`"
991..1070 Comment "/// included; β reads an introduced cell\'s value at the point off the face; η"
1071..1112 Comment "/// rebuilds a cell from its value there."
1113..1115 Other "@["
1116..1126 Other "normalizes"
1126..1127 Other "("
1127..1128 StringLit "\""
1128..1213 StringLit "cells(outCellp(c), outCellq(inCell(one)), inCell(outCellq(c))) ~> cells(zero, one, c)"
1213..1214 StringLit "\""
1214..1215 Other ")"
1216..1217 Other "]"
